stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 72 698 Td (Travel and Expense Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 675 Td (Policy owner: Finance. Version 3.2, effective January 1, 2025. This policy applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 660 Td (all employees of Acme Corporation who travel or incur expenses on company business.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 638 Td (1. Approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 615 Td (All business travel must be approved in advance by the employee's manager through the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 600 Td (travel booking tool. International travel also requires approval from a Vice President.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 578 Td (2. Air Travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 555 Td (Employees book economy class for flights scheduled at six \(6\) hours or less. Business) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 540 Td (class is allowed for flights scheduled at more than six \(6\) hours, with the approval of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 525 Td (a Vice President. Tickets should be booked at least fourteen \(14\) days before departure) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 510 Td (when possible.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 488 Td (3. Hotels) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 465 Td (The nightly hotel rate, excluding taxes, may not exceed US$250. In New York, London and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 450 Td (San Francisco the limit is US$325 per night. Employees must use the preferred hotels) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 435 Td (listed in the booking tool when one is available.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 413 Td (4. Meals) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 390 Td (Employees receive a meal per diem of US$75 per full travel day, and US$40 on the days of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 375 Td (departure and return. The per diem replaces individual meal receipts. Alcohol is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 360 Td (reimbursable, except during client entertainment approved in advance by a Director.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 338 Td (5. Ground Transportation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 315 Td (Employees should use public transport or taxis. Rental cars are allowed when cheaper) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 300 Td (than the alternatives or when traveling with colleagues. Use of a personal car is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 285 Td (reimbursed at US$0.67 per mile.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 263 Td (6. Receipts and Submission) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 240 Td (An itemized receipt is required for every expense of US$25 or more. Expense claims must) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 225 Td (be submitted within thirty \(30\) days after the trip ends. Claims submitted more than) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 210 Td (ninety \(90\) days after the trip are not reimbursed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 188 Td (7. Non-reimbursable Expenses) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 165 Td (The following are not reimbursed: upgrades paid for personally, airline lounge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 150 Td (memberships, traffic and parking fines, personal entertainment, and expenses for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 135 Td (spouse or family member.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 113 Td (8. Corporate Card) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 90 Td (Employees who travel more than four \(4\) times per year are issued a corporate card.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 75 Td (Personal expenses must never be charged to it.) Tj ET
endstream
